  "historyNote": "#7178, eff 12-23-99, EXPIRED: 12-23-07 New. #9065, eff 1-10-08; ss by #11032, eff 1-29-16; ss by #13126-B, eff 10-24-20; ss by #13450, eff 9-23-22; ss by #14573, eff 5-2-26, EXPIRES: 5-2-36",
